UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Northwest Arkansas play is spread across the metro. Mahjong Mama NWA holds regular Mahj Club evenings at Loma in Rogers, plus Mahjong 101 classes and open play at venues in Bentonville, Fayetteville, Bella Vista, Gravette and Springdale. Mockingbird & Magnolia Mahjong, based in Bentonville, offers public classes, private lessons and open play. Mahjong Mama teaches American mah jongg with the National Mah Jongg League card and asks beginners to bring a current card. New players can start with a Mahjong 101 class.' WHERE "slug" = 'rogers';
